# Imago

Developed under the supervison of Prof. Alexandre Xavier Falcão at LIDS - University of Campinas

## Install

```sh
mkdir build
cd build
cmake -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/<qt path> ..
// cmake .. -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=<path>/Qt/<version>/gcc_64
cmake --build . --config Release
```


## Use

```sh
cd build
./imago
```
